=== JSON WEB TOKEN ==== Ananlysis ===

Request → Middleware check → (Pass হলে) Route → Response

[ Client (Browser / App) ]
            |
            | 1. Login Request (username, password)
            v
[ Server (/auth/login route) ]
            |
            | 2. Check credentials
            | 3. Generate JWT
            v
[ Token Returned to Client ]
            |
            | 4. Client stores token (localStorage / cookie)
            |
            | 5. Request to Protected Route
            |    (Authorization: Bearer TOKEN)
            v
[ Middleware (verifyToken) ]   🔐
            |
      ┌─────┴─────┐
      |           |
      | Valid     | Invalid
      v           v
[ Next() ]    [ Error Response ]
      |           |
      v           |
[ Protected Route ] ❌ access denied
      |
      v
[ Send Protected Data ]



==== Step-by-step  ====

1. Login phase
Client → username/password দেয়
Server → check করে
ঠিক হলে → JWT token দেয়

2. Access phase
Client → request পাঠায় token সহ
Middleware → আগে intercept করে

3. Decision phase (Middleware)
✔️ Token valid → next() → route execute
❌ Token invalid → error → route-এ ঢুকতেই পারবে না

Core Idea
👉 Middleware হচ্ছে gatekeeper
👉 Route হচ্ছে main resource


==== EXAMPLE ONLINE STORE ====
Scenario: User Order দেখতে চায় (Protected)
১. Login → Token Generate
২. Middleware → Token Check
৩. Protected Route → Orders দেখানো
-----------

------
auth.js => ১. Login → Token Generate
--------
router.post("/login", (req, res) => {
  const { email, password } = req.body;

  if (email === "user@gmail.com" && password === "1234") {
    const token = jwt.sign(
      { userId: "u1001", role: "customer" },
      "secret123",
      { expiresIn: "1h" }
    );

    res.json({ token });
  } else {
    res.status(401).json({ message: "Invalid login" });
  }
});


------
Middleware.js => ২. Middleware → Token Check
--------
function verifyToken(req, res, next) {
  const auth = req.headers.authorization;

  if (!auth) return res.status(403).json({ message: "No token" });

  const token = auth.split(" ")[1];

  jwt.verify(token, "secret123", (err, decoded) => {
    if (err) return res.status(401).json({ message: "Invalid token" });

    req.user = decoded;
    next();
  });
}


------
index.js => ৩. Protected Route → Orders দেখানো
--------
router.get("/orders", verifyToken, (req, res) => {
  res.json({
    message: "Your orders",
    userId: req.user.userId
  });
});